recommend keep-going The queue's lead is ungated and now stands alone by a wide margin: provision_notes at 2093 across 24 rungs, with release_the_standing at 1633 across 24 and stand_the_mark at 1624 across 29 behind it. reap_oldest at 1584 across 37 is the better crux on rung count, and it is one of the four spine bodies fold M already widened, so it may well be another free fold. provision_notes at ninety-one lines stays the body most likely to reach a rung's own wire. Hash the family first, hash each private symbol's own family before widening it, and read every absentee for BOTH kinds rather than one: this lap found a body wearing both at once, and the rule that settled it is that dating outranks reach, since no accessor can give a body back a check it never had. The one gate worth Keaton's eye stays small and unchanged: jinja2 and ply on the pier's Python environment open the seL4 generated headers in a single step, which is an environment change and so his word.
